## 🎯 System Overview

**Kazyon Smart ERP Core** is a high-performance, ultra-fast, offline-first multi-user web application engineered specifically for retail branch operations (tailored for Kazyon Market workflows). It bridges the gap between fast-paced store floor execution and real-time administrative control, allowing staff to manage inventory, scan barcodes instantly, and sync data seamlessly across multiple devices.

---

## 🔑 Authentication Matrix

To preserve strict enterprise security, quick-login shortcuts are disabled. Use the appropriate credentials based on your clearance level:

| Role | Username | Password | Operational Capabilities & Permissions |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 👑 **Main Admin** | `General` | `6060` | Full system control, inventory management, bulk file imports (`.xlsx`, `.pdf`), pricing control, and live **Security & IP Activity Logging**. |
| ⚡ **Store Staff** | `admin` | `123` | Restricted graphical mobile interface optimized for single-hand use, instant camera barcode scanning, and fast price checking. |

