* **Live Web App:** [https://a7med606.github.io/kazyon-inventory-app/](https://a7med606.github.io/kazyon-inventory-app/)
* **Compatibility:** Fully optimized for Android smartphones, tablets, and desktop browsers with PWA support.

---

## ⚡ Core Architectural Highlights

1. **🔄 Real-Time Cloud Synchronization:** Powered by Firebase to ensure instant cross-device state updates without refreshing pages.
2. **📷 Hyper-Fast Camera Barcode Scanner:** Optimized HTML5 camera stream (`navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia`) with dynamic resolution scaling for zero-lag mobile execution on Android.
3. **💾 Offline-First Caching Engine:** Aggressive `localStorage` and IndexedDB caching layers allowing the app to load instantly (0ms delay) even with unstable branch connectivity.
4. **📊 Smart Bulk Importer:** Drag-and-drop or file-picker support for Excel (`.xlsx`) and PDF files to update inventory in bulk without manual typing.
5. **🛡️ Dynamic IP Tracking:** Automatically captures and logs client IP addresses upon login for administrative audit trails.

